abstract: "Two research manuscripts and reproducible checks concerning fixed-parameter quantum polylogarithm relations and raw finite quantum-dilogarithm schemes. The revised finite-etale proof includes universal-ring realization and normalized reconstruction over dual numbers; the manuscripts remain internally audited research drafts."
keywords:
  - quantum polylogarithms
  - quantum dilogarithms
  - iterated integrals
  - shuffle algebras
  - finite schemes
  - infinitesimal rigidity
